<h2>Welcome aboard, <%= name %>!</h2>

<p>Your account is verified and ready to go.</p>

<% if (role==="VENDOR" ) { %>
  <p>
    Our team is reviewing your vendor details. Once approved, you'll be able to list products and start selling. We'll
    notify you here as soon as it's done - typically within 24-48 hours.
  </p>
  <% } else { %>
    <p>
      Discover thousands of products from verified sellers. Your next favourite thing is just a click away.
    </p>
    <% } %>

      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="<%= appUrl %>" class="btn">
          <% if (role==="VENDOR" ) { %>Open Vendor Dashboard<% } else { %>Start Shopping<% } %>
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="muted-sm">
        Need help? Reply to this email or visit our help centre - we're happy to assist.
      </p>